        "id": "1",
        "kind": "comment",
        "config": {
          "text": "Music that writes itself, the same way every time. Press Space to play.\n\nA sixteenth-note Clock drives two Euclidean rhythms. On every hit a Random node picks a pitch and Scale Quantize snaps it to A minor pentatonic, so nothing is ever out of key; Note To MIDI turns the hit and the note into MIDI for a polyphonic instrument block. The random choices come from the project's seed, so the patch plays the same tune on every play and every render, until you change the seed."
        },
        "ui": {
          "pos": [
            0.0,
            -296.0
